  <div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">LOCKDOWN / PLAYER GUIDE</div><h1>How To Play &amp; Rules</h1><p>New to Lockdown? Your story starts here.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/city">Back to the city →</a></div>
  <section class="dashboard-panel">
    <h2>Welcome to Lockdown</h2>
    <p>A new city can feel like a lot to take in. Start small: train your stats, find work, study a course and learn where everything is. You will build your money, equipment and reputation over time.</p>
    <p>Follow the chapters below at your own pace. Click a chapter title to reveal its steps, then use the links to try them in the game. You can return through <strong>How To</strong> at the top of any game page.</p>
    <nav class="guide-contents" aria-label="Guide contents">
      <a href="#rules">Game rules</a><a href="#getting-started">1. Getting started</a><a href="#first-fight">2. Prepare for your first fight</a><a href="#exploring-one">3. Explore the city</a><a href="#criminal-methods">4. Criminal methods</a><a href="#weapons">5. Weapons &amp; other players</a><a href="#exploring-two">6. City services &amp; factions</a><a href="#stats">7. Build your stats</a><a href="#exploring-three">8. Progress &amp; travel</a><a href="#next-steps">9. Well on your way</a><a href="#casino">Casino</a><a href="#medical">Healing &amp; cooldowns</a><a href="#resources">Resource quick reference</a>
