<section id="casino" class="dashboard-panel"><h2>Casino &amp; awards</h2><p>Visit the <a href="/casino">Casino</a> for nine games unlocked between levels 2 and 8. Receive 75 Casino Tokens each UTC day. Poker uses no tokens; other games use one per round, ticket, wager or seat. Casino Tokens are separate from voting Tokens.</p><p>Refill at the <a href="/points">Points Building</a> for 30 points, use a Casino Pass, or work as a Gaming Consultant for a daily refill. Poker is two-player five-card draw. Russian Roulette wagers in-game cash only. See <a href="/awards">Awards</a> for your milestones. Wagers can lose; read the rules and payout shown before playing.</p></section>
<section id="medical" class="dashboard-panel"><h2>Healing &amp; cooldowns</h2><p><a href="/hospital">Hospital</a> shows your life, blood type, cooldowns and owned medical supplies. Small First Aid Kits, First Aid Kits and Morphine heal 5%, 10% and 15% life and remove 20, 40 and 70 minutes of standard hospital time.</p><p>Medicine adds time to a shared timer. You can use more while it remains below six hours. Drugs have a separate timer; Opium clears standard hospital time and restores life up to 50%, with a temporary defense bonus. Boosters cannot be used in hospital.</p><p>Study Intravenous Therapy to fill and use compatible blood bags. A filled bag heals 30% and removes 120 minutes. Medical Effectiveness education and faction upgrades improve healing and time removed. Qualify and work as a Brain Surgeon to unlock revives; patients can disable them. Reviving costs energy and can fail. Select patients in the Hospital I.C.U.</p></section>
